v1.3.6
Online source-IP reliability and visibility: per-email fallback now triggers when
the aggregate statistics RPC fails or returns malformed data, probes up to 128
users, parses both Xray response shapes, and reads online session counts.
Recent IP history is retained for seven days (64 addresses per user), the online
view and user details show last-online timestamps, and /onlinedoctor reports
per-user session and observed-IP counts with a loopback-relay hint.
